e snapshot reachable at index 0 holds. The comparisons require the six-index baseline before the call, that the call is accepted, that the compacted index does not pass the six indices of content, that the produced snapshot holds the five decided entries, and that every replica still reports six indices afterwards; the source prediction is that the request is accepted and the snapshot is built from an empty range, so the compacted index passes the content and the snapshot holds none of the entries.\\\"),\n \\\"experiment\\\":exp}\njson.dump(up, open('update.json','w'), indent=1); print('written')\nPY\ntimeout 120 /home/nitro/Desktop/consensus-assurance/.venv/bin/python -I -B -c \\\"import sys; sys.path.insert(0, '/home/nitro/Desktop/consensus-assurance/src'); from consensus_assurance.cli import main; raise SystemExit(main())\\\" validate --run /home/nitro/Desktop/consensus-assurance/runs/2026-10-16_09-22-17-omnipaxos-real-run --submission update.json 2>&1 | head -c 800\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
